   "text": "For the sake of dynamic calibration, add a sensor baseline initialization block. The sensor we will be using throughout this guide is a microphone. If you are not sure how to connect a microphone or what is dynamic calibration, go back to 'Working with Analog Sensors' guide and refresh your memory.",
   "title": "",
   "addToBackground": false,
   "muted": false,
   "autoPlay": false,
